{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-014","source_id":"s-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang-ws2262003","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang:p001","quote":"衡陽獻王昌字敬業，高祖第六子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang:p001:m0004","object_person_reference_id":"c-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang:p001:r0009","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-014-zhangyaoer-chang:p001","surface":"高祖第六子","start":9,"end":14}}]}],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002","text":"高祖自廣州南征交阯，命后與衡陽王昌隨世祖由海道歸于長城。侯景之亂，高祖下至豫章，后為景所囚。景平，而高祖為長城縣公，后拜夫人。及高祖踐祚，永定元年立為皇后。追贈后父景明特進、金紫光祿大夫，加金章紫綬，拜后母蘇安吉縣君。二年，安吉君卒，與后父合葬吳興。明年，追封后父為廣德縣侯，邑五百戶，謚曰溫。高祖崩，后與中書舍人蔡景歷定計，祕不發喪，召世祖入纂，事在蔡景歷及侯安都傳。世祖即位，尊后為皇太后，宮曰慈訓。廢帝即位，尊后為太皇太后。光大二年，后下令黜廢帝為臨海王，命高宗嗣位。太建元年，尊后為皇太后。二年三月景申，崩于紫極殿，時年六十五。遺令喪事所須，並從儉約，諸有饋奠，不得用牲牢。其年四月，羣臣上謚曰宣太后，祔葬萬安陵。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0016","surface":"昌","start":16,"end":17,"person_id":"3eu_ixs_h1w_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0028","surface":"侯景","start":28,"end":30,"person_id":"5d1_8jg_amy","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0082","surface":"景明","start":82,"end":84,"person_id":"bb6_de0_sx1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0103","surface":"蘇","start":103,"end":104,"person_id":"w57_43n_jd8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0157","surface":"蔡景歷","start":157,"end":160,"person_id":"3iw_d6v_459_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0176","surface":"蔡景歷","start":176,"end":179,"person_id":"3iw_d6v_459_A","kind"